Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:49.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,这地方真难找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sure had a hard time finding this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:51.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他的笔迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说过他是我朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I said, he's a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:58.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫蓝波  越战时我们服役同部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is John Rambo, We served on the same team together in Nam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.14,0:03:00.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知他是否提过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if he ever talked about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:04.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有一张我们合照的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a picture of us together,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:08.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,在某个地方...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere,
