Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,去年夏天死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died last summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:38.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么死的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Died. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:43.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,死于癌症  在越南得的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cancer, Brought it back from Nam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:47.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们到处喷化学药剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that orange stuff they spreaded around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:50.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,让他变成了皮包骨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut him down to nothing,
