Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:02.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,早安  安妮 你们好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Annie, How you doing, girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:04.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 很好  谢谢  - 今早还好吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great, Thanks, - You all right this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:09.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 安笛  - 好  威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Andy! - Howdy, Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:24.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 早安  戴夫  - 好  警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Morning, Dave,  - Hi, sheriff,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.29,0:05:26.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,这周去温泉泡澡吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna take a bath this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:35.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:43.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你来这里拜访什么人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, uh, you visiting somebody around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:45.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:50.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,看你夹克上绣的国旗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, wearing that flag on that jacket,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:52.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,和你的德行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looking the way you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:54.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是来这里找麻烦的  朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're asking for trouble around here, friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:57.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 北上还是南下?  - 北上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Headed north or south?  - North.
