Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:19.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要去那里?  - 波特兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where you headed?  - Portland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:22.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是在南边  你刚才说要北上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Portland is south.  You said you were headed north,
