Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:37.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,有  犯着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:40.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为何逼人太甚?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you pushing me?
