Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:08.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且  你不会喜欢这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, you wouldn't like it here,
