Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:04.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你逃不了多远了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gone as far as you're gonna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:09.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你听到没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:17.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,麦屈!  莱斯特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitch! Lester!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.97,0:22:21.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在山岭上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's up there, beyond the draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:23.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,麦屈  用无线电呼叫奥佛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitch, get Orval on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.47,0:22:27.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,叫他立刻带狗来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to get out here with his damn dogs right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:29.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,叫他带杜宾犬来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tell him to bring the Dobermans,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.48,0:22:31.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,快下雨了  我们需要那些能依视觉追猎的狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna rain. We'll need dogs that can hunt on sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:32.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,好！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.48,0:22:34.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,叫高尔到集木场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lester, tell Galt to get out to the lumber camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:36.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫他带直升机来  - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell him to get the helicopter up here.  - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:37.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们抱怨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they give him any shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.99,0:22:41.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,就叫妨碍公务逮捕!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell him to cite them for obstruction right on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.49,0:22:47.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会抓到他  没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get him, No problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.53,0:23:22.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点  狗儿  打猎开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Duke, Thunder, Let's get him,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:26.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,加油!  甜心  就这样宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, sweethearts, That's it, babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.03,0:23:27.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,去抓他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:29.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,很快就可以抓到他了吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be done in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:32.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很快就可以把他剥制成标本了  是吧  威尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be long before you have this one stuffed and mounted, huh, Will?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去年来这里猎过鹿吧?  {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didrt we go deer hunting here last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.09,0:23:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  去年我猎到些公鹿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I got a couple bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:40.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在要射杀他  - 麦屈  在山顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll shoot anything,  - Hey, Mitch, up the hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.57,0:24:02.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,别让它们接近我  奥佛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep those dogs away from me, Orval
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.07,0:24:04.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不信任它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't trust those bastards,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.07,0:24:08.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续跑  我的狗可以边跑边吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving, 'cause my dogs can eat and run at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.58,0:24:10.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,他准备上山顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's heading straight for the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.58,0:24:14.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这人可能有危险吗?  - 他完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this guy supposed to be dangerous?  - He's just dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.60,0:24:32.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心  你破坏他的气味了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Walt, you're spoiling the scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.10,0:24:35.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我的狗去追  - 去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let my babies do the job.  - Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:37.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在这跟着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trailing you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.11,0:24:40.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有用  - 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is no good,  - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:43.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,当时在搂下我们有三个人对付他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were three of us on him in the cell block.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.61,0:24:45.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,他闯出去如入无人之境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went through us like we werert even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.12,0:24:48.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,少来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.15,0:25:22.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走  狗儿  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, babies, Come on, Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.65,0:25:25.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey. Okay, Thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.19,0:26:02.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点  我们困住他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Duke, We got him cornered,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.19,0:26:05.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿舍  这是提索  他在往查普曼峡谷走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Art, this is Teasle, He's headed for Chapman Gorge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.72,0:26:08.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,查普曼峡谷  去追他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chapman Gorge, Head him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.23,0:26:44.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在那  悬崖上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is! On the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.25,0:27:04.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell 's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.26,0:27:16.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么?  我们应该只是看住他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? We're just supposed to spot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:17.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,保持稳定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it steady,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.77,0:27:20.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能  我们在乱流中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't! We're in a thermal draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.27,0:27:23.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,他困在那边  那里也去不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galt, he's stuck there, He can't go anyplace,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.27,0:27:27.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是你不好好开直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't fly this thing right,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.28,0:27:30.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我向天发誓  我会收拾你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God, I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.78,0:27:33.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,警长呼叫高尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff to Galt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.79,0:27:40.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,保持稳定  你狗娘养的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it steady, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.79,0:27:44.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,高尔  回答!  可恶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galt, come in, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.29,0:27:45.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,靠近点  保持稳定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in closer and hold it steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.79,0:27:48.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,高尔  跟我说话  我要知道究竟怎么回事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galt, talk to me. I want to know what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.30,0:27:53.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我打中他了  慢点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him, Easy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.33,0:28:24.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dw! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.35,0:28:41.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.85,0:28:43.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,到那边去  快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's over there, dummy. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:47.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.36,0:28:51.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿兵哥!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, soldier boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.36,0:28:58.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,接近点  他在那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, move it down the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.37,0:29:05.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,保持稳定!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.37,0:29:07.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.38,0:29:13.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,高尔  我叫你听无线电!  怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galt, get on this radio! What's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.39,0:29:20.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道怎么回事  听见没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him alive, Galt! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.39,0:29:21.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,高尔  回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Art, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.89,0:29:24.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.45,0:30:23.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,阿舍!高尔!回答!  直升机回答!  该死的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Art Galt, come in, Helicopter, come in, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.45,0:30:25.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!  看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.96,0:30:32.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!  拿望远镜给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ, Give me the binoculars, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:36.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,不  不  糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dh, no, no, no, Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.47,0:30:43.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.01,0:31:23.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想不透{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't figure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.01,0:31:26.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么摔出去的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd he fall out?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.51,0:31:27.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.52,0:31:30.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,他几乎打中那小子  他逃不远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's nail this sucker's ass, He can't be far.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.52,0:31:31.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.02,0:31:36.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来他想自首{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like he wants to turn himself in,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.53,0:31:40.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,死了一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one man dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.03,0:31:45.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是我的错  我不要再有人受伤!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault! I don't want any more hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.03,0:31:46.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,别动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,站在原地别动  投降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand right where you are! Give yourself up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.54,0:31:51.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我什么也没做!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.54,0:31:54.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我警告你  别动  否则打死你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, don't make a move! I'll blow your head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.54,0:31:57.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也没做!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.05,0:32:05.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,停火!  停火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cease fire! Cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.05,0:32:07.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  停火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ward, goddamn it, cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.06,0:32:10.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们打中他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.06,0:32:11.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们下去  快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get down there, Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.06,0:32:16.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,警长呼叫基地  请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff to base. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.14,0:32:21.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,说吧!  威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Will,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.07,0:32:24.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯特  我们现在在峡谷底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lester, we're down in the gorge,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.57,0:32:27.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,高尔死了  直升机在那里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galt 's dead all right, Where the hell is that goddamn chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.58,0:32:31.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不来  他说有暴风雨朝你的方向去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't come, Will, Says there's a storm headed your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.08,0:32:33.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不管有什么来 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't give a goddamn what's on its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.01,0:32:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 我要直升机快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want that chopper back here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.58,0:32:37.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不要高尔的尸体停在这里整夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want Galt 's body out here all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.59,0:32:38.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我尽力而为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.59,0:32:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威尔  你真会挑人找麻烦 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, you picked one hell of a guy to mess around with.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.85,0:32:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 刚才电脑输出资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} This came over the Teletype.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.09,0:32:45.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波是越战退伍军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Rambo is a Vietnam vet.
