Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.95,0:41:30.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,天...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.95,0:41:35.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我本可以杀光他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could 've killed them all.
