Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.02,0:42:47.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点  退后  - 退后  伙计们  退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Get back,  - Move back, you guys, Move back,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.04,0:42:58.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,长官  我们需要聊聊  发生什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, can we have a comment on what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.54,0:43:01.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,状况有多糟?  长官  我们需要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How bad is the situation? Captain, we need some...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.04,0:43:03.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only good thing to come out of this mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.54,0:43:05.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,只对镇上生意有好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the business we're doing in town.
