Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.55,0:43:16.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,何不回家去?  现在我的问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go home? It's my problem now.
