Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.66,0:43:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.06,0:43:23.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,要我出去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like me to step outside?
