Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.07,0:43:27.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,在此岩山荒野某处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere in this rugged mountain countryside,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.07,0:43:31.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能在雪线上的薄雾之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}possibly above the snow line, shrouded in mist,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.57,0:43:34.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,藏着亡命的退伍军人蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the fugitive John Rambo is hiding.
