Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.58,0:43:43.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,当地警方仍未解释的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What still remains unexplained by local authorities,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.08,0:43:45.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,这前绿扁帽从何处以及如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is just how and where the former Green Beret,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.09,0:43:47.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,得到武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Came into possession of the weapons with which
