Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.09,0:43:54.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他们的警署特训技能救了他们的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only their skilled training in police enforcement techniques saved their lives.
