Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.12,0:44:26.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,这有差别吗?  戴夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesrt make one goddamn bit of difference, Dave,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.63,0:44:28.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你心里有数!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.13,0:44:32.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,若我的副警长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if one of my deputies,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.13,0:44:33.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,对犯人太过分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gets out of line with a prisoner,
