Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.66,0:45:01.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,山姆  崔普曼  崔普曼上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam Trautman, Colonel Samuel Trautman.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.66,0:45:04.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,今早我们有点忙  有什么我能效劳的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a little busy, Colonel. What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.16,0:45:05.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我来接我的部下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to get my boy.
