Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.93,0:45:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会很小心  上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will try to be extra careful
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:44.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他让你们生还我真惊奇  - 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm just amazed that he allowed any of your posse to live.  - Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.70,0:45:47.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,坦白说  他失手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strictly speaking, he slipped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.21,0:45:50.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还活着算你走运  - 这可好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're lucky to be breathing.  - That's just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.21,0:45:55.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,上校  你来此检查你的机器为何失灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, you came out here to find out why one of your machines blew a gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.22,0:45:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不承认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seem to want to accept the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.12,0:46:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是在跟游击战专家交手这个事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you're dealing with an expert in guerrilla warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.22,0:46:05.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不但善于刀枪  更是赤手空拳的高手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a man who's the best,with guns, with knives, with his bare hands.
