Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.73,0:46:10.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,无视天气  在野外求生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ignore weather,to live off the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.73,0:46:14.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,会吃连山羊都吃不下的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to eat things that would make a billy goat puke,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.24,0:46:18.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在越南的任务是暗杀敌军人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Vietnam, his job was to dispose of enemy personnel
