Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.74,0:46:22.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,一点点消磨取胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Win by attrition,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.24,0:46:25.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是个中顶尖高手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Rambo was the best,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.80,0:47:23.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,好  上校  你吓死我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Colonel, you got us all scared to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.80,0:47:25.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你和特战部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you and the Special Forces
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.38,0:47:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为我该如何对付你的疯子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think I ought to do about your psycho out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.31,0:47:31.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 放他走  - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let him go.  - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.44,0:47:32.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是目前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.31,0:47:36.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,解除一切状况和他的危险性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diffuse the whole situation. Diffuse him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.82,0:47:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提供间隙让他溜走 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Provide a little gap and let him slip through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.46,0:47:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 再全国性通缉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Then put out a nationwide APB.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.82,0:47:43.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,几星期后会在西雅图或者其他地方抓到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a couple of weeks, you'll pick him up in Seattle or someplace,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.82,0:47:44.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,他会在洗车场工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}working in a car wash,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.82,0:47:46.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会有战斗  没人会受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll be no fight, Nobody else will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.33,0:47:48.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作我自己做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do my own work,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.33,0:47:52.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会放弃  把希望放在他会在西雅图被抓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't close my eyes and hope he gets picked up in Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.33,0:47:54.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,若你派你的人去他们会送命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you send your people in there after him, they'll get killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:58.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是小镇的小派出所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just a small, hick town sheriff's department,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.34,0:48:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们和那位特战部队英雄一样 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we're expected to do our duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.44,0:48:01.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 都被人期望尽到职责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like our heroes in the Special Forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.84,0:48:03.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在特战部队教他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Special Forces, we teach our people
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.84,0:48:05.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,在执行勤务时保命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stay alive in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.35,0:48:06.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的?  我可没想到过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.85,0:48:08.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要打一场赢不了的战争吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a war you can't win?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.35,0:48:12.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,二百个人对付你的人赢不了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me that 200 men against your boy is a no-win situation for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.85,0:48:15.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你派他们去别忘了一件事?  - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You send that many, don't forget one thing.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.36,0:48:17.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,提供足够的尸袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good supply of body bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.86,0:48:22.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,崔普曼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trautman!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.86,0:48:27.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你支持那一边  崔普曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know which side you're on, Trautman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.37,0:48:30.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你只是来掩饰你的过错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still think you came out here just to cover your ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.37,0:48:34.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,若你当真想救蓝波  跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you're serious about taking Rambo out clean, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.39,0:48:47.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,Dang{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.40,0:48:59.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,州警呼叫蓝波  请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State Police calling John Rambo. Acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.41,0:49:10.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,州警呼叫蓝波  请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State Police calling John Rambo. Come in, please. Acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.91,0:49:14.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,若你在听  以下是你的处境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're listening, Rambo, here is your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.91,0:49:18.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,你被包围了  所有出路都被封锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are surrounded. Every possible exit has been blocked,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.42,0:49:21.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,每条公路道路  防火道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every highway, every road, every firebreak,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.42,0:49:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的服役表现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have our word that your services to your country,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.91,0:49:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会被列入考虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be taken into consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.43,0:49:27.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会接受公平对待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will receive fair treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.43,0:49:30.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要回答  我们可以商量一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just respond, We can work everything out. Dver.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.93,0:49:32.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,有结果吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.93,0:49:34.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,他拿走我的一位副警长的无线电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took a radio off of one of my deputies,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.93,0:49:36.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,他一定在听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he has to be listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.94,0:49:39.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,若我是他  我会收听一些情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was in his position, I'd try to pick up information,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.44,0:49:41.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 听别人交谈  - 他当然在听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe catch some cross talk,  - Of course he's listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.94,0:49:43.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他不会说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's not gonna break radio silence,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.94,0:49:47.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不会跟我们通话  也许会跟你  上校!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Not for us, But he might do it for you, Colonel
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.45,0:49:49.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的部下  不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your boy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.45,0:49:56.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许你能说服他投降好救我们命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can talk him into sparing all our lives by giving himself up,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.46,0:49:58.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.46,0:50:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若你不介意为我们设计他 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, we'll get a radio fix on his position,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.10,0:50:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 我们可用无线电查到他的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} if you don't mind setting him up for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.46,0:50:03.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,为你们设计他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Setting him up for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.96,0:50:06.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就像把鸟带到猫面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It 's like bringing the pigeons to the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.47,0:50:10.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.47,0:50:14.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你带人来  - 随时候教  威尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Don, thanks for bringing your people out.  - Any time, Will,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.97,0:50:19.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,伙计  把杂志拿开认真点  也许机会只有一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bobby, put the magazine away, Pay attention. We may only get one crack at this,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.48,0:50:28.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,连长呼叫乌鸦!  乌鸦请回答!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covey Leader calling Raven. Come on, Raven.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.49,0:50:33.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,连长呼叫乌鸦!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covey Leader calling Raven.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.50,0:50:39.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,连长呼叫乌鸦!  跟我说话  强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covey Leader to Raven. Talk to me, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.50,0:50:47.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,连长点名  蓝波  麦斯纳  欧太加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covey Leader to identify Baker Team, Rambo, Messner, Ortega,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.01,0:50:54.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉达  乔根森  丹佛贝  瑞克瑞  奥尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coletta, Jorgensen, Danforth, Barry, Krackauer,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.01,0:50:56.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.52,0:50:58.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是崔普曼上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Col. Trautman.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.52,0:51:01.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说话  强尼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to me, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.04,0:51:17.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们全死了  长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all gone, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.54,0:51:19.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他!  追踪下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him. Get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.54,0:51:22.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波  你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, are you all right? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.54,0:51:24.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,本小队全阵亡了  长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baker Team, they're all dead, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.55,0:51:28.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝瑞没死  他生还了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Delmar Barry. He made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.05,0:51:32.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他也死了  长官  - 怎么死的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Barry's gone too, sir.  - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.55,0:51:36.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,在越南就快死了  他全不知情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got himself killed in Nam, Didn't even know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.06,0:51:39.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,癌症使他只剩下皮包骨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cancer ate him down to the bone,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.06,0:51:41.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.06,0:51:45.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是仅剩的  长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the last one, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.57,0:51:49.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,听到你的声音真好  强尼  好久不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to hear your voice, Johnny. It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.07,0:51:52.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在此造成一些破坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, John, you've done some damage here,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.57,0:51:54.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们不希望再有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they don't want any more trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.57,0:51:56.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他  在西北方 他在西北方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Northwest. He's northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.58,0:51:58.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I've come,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.08,0:52:01.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要去你那边  带你离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna come in there and fly you the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.08,0:52:03.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有你和我  我们一起解决这事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just you and me. We'll work this thing out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.58,0:52:05.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,够公平了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that fair enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.59,0:52:08.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你从哪里来  长官?  - 布莱登堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you come from, sir?  - Bragg.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.09,0:52:13.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我试图找你  但他们不知去那找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to reach you, but the guys at Bragg never knew where to find you,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.59,0:52:16.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,最近我很少待在布莱登堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been spending much time there lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.60,0:52:19.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们把我调到华府  坐办公桌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got me down in D.C. I'm shining a seat with my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.60,0:52:21.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,但愿我现在回到布莱登堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I was back at Bragg now,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.60,0:52:28.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你出来后我们再谈这事  - 我办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll talk about that when you come in.  - I can't do that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.11,0:52:34.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  强尼  我们不能让你亡命山中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look, John, we can't have you running around
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.11,0:52:35.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀死友善百姓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wastir friendly civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.11,0:52:37.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,百姓没有友善的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no friendly civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.62,0:52:39.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的朋友  强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your friend, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.62,0:52:43.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,越战时我和你生死与共  肝胆相照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there with you knee-deep in all that blood and guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.12,0:52:45.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我掩护你不止一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I covered your ass more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.63,0:52:51.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,看爱我今生都要把你从麻烦中救出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems like bailir you out of trouble is gettir to be a lifetime job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.13,0:52:54.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有那个霸王警长  也就没有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There wouldn't be no trouble except for that king-shit cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.63,0:52:56.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只想要吃一餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I wanted was something to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.64,0:52:59.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,他却一再逼我  长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the man kept pushing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.14,0:53:02.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也逼人太甚  强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did some pushing of your own, John,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.14,0:53:05.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他们逼我流第一滴血  不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They drew first blood, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.14,0:53:08.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,强尼  让我去带你离开那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Johnny, let me come in and get you the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.65,0:53:12.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他们逼我流第一滴血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They drew first blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波  你仍然听得见我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, are you still reading me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.67,0:53:33.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,请回答!  连长呼叫乌鸦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covey Leader to Raven, Rambo, acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.17,0:53:36.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,他完了  上校!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all finished, Colonel
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.18,0:53:39.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们找出他的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a real good fix on him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.18,0:53:42.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,天一亮我就带所有人上那山脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come first light, I'm gonna put every man I got up on that ridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.68,0:53:44.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后我以我的方法抓他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll get him my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.19,0:53:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你横越这座山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, look down. I want you to stretch the skirmish
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.13,0:53:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设下前哨线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}line right across this ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.19,0:53:54.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死!  该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.70,0:54:06.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,快!  快走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.21,0:54:10.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们追{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.21,0:54:12.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,这小子有枪吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this guy got a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.72,0:54:18.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心脚步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your step,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.22,0:54:20.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?  那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.73,0:54:28.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,他走的哪条路?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which way did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.23,0:54:30.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,翻过去  翻过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toss it across. Toss it,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.28,0:55:24.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pa! Pa! Pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.28,0:55:25.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那里有个人  - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a guy over there!  - What happened, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.79,0:55:28.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看到他了  在那边  - 我去抓他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I see him! Over there!  - I' II get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.79,0:55:30.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪  冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot! Cool down!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.79,0:55:32.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,这边!  我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.80,0:55:40.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在那边  快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.82,0:55:59.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们打中他了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.82,0:56:06.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他在那里  仔细听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Yes, I know exactly where it is. Listen to me very carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.33,0:56:09.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,用你所有的人包围那里但别进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surround the area with every man you've got, but don't move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.33,0:56:11.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没到之前  什么也别做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, don't move in, In fact, don't do anything 'til I get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.33,0:56:15.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪我不要死的  我要活的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no shooting. I don't want him dead. I want him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.84,0:56:24.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,爬下!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.85,0:56:35.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.19,0:56:39.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,快!  开枪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys, Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.69,0:56:42.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:46.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们真了不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you guys are great,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.20,0:56:47.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗  史提夫  - 有!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, Steve?  - Yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.70,0:56:50.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要你和布鲁抄到矿坑前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you and Bruce, head around these trees, go to the front of that mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.70,0:56:54.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,去你的  克林顿  我才不去  门都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw that, Clinton, I ain't goir up there, No way,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.21,0:56:59.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 雷门  - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Raymond?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.21,0:57:03.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要你进矿坑  - 我才不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want you to go into that mine.  - Oh, not me,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.22,0:57:04.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,这话什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "not me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.72,0:57:07.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的兼差  我不是来送命的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I do this part-time, I didn't come to get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.22,0:57:09.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,他可能正在里面等我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's probably in there just waitir for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.72,0:57:11.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病  克林顿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you, Clinton?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.73,0:57:22.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,蓝波  我是摩根中尉国民军连长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Rambo? This is Lieutenant Clinton Morgen, National Guard leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.74,0:57:28.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我给你三十秒出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'm giving you just three-zero seconds to come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.11,0:57:32.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,火箭筒在谁手上?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's got the rocket launcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.75,0:57:35.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我  - 过来  尔洛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I do,  - Come here, Earl
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.75,0:57:39.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好  蓝波  这是你出来的最后机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, Rambo, this is your last chance to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.75,0:57:42.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们应该等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we should wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.26,0:57:45.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,尔洛  这坏蛋是个杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earl, this creep is a killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.76,0:57:48.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,何况  是我指挥  我说要炸死他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I' m in charge, and I say we blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.76,0:57:52.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,发射它!  先让我离远一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now fire that thing, Just let me get out of the way first,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.29,0:58:21.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,给他一根雪茄  正中目标!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give that man a cigar! Bull 's-eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.33,0:59:04.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们在那里?  - 往山上走约五百码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where the hell are they?  - Up the hill about 500 yards,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.84,0:59:10.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,走近点  象吉马一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move in a little closer, just like Iwo Jima,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.84,0:59:14.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信  白痴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it. Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.85,0:59:15.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,别动  好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady, Got it,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.85,0:59:19.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 再给福兵照一张  - 福兵?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, Nick. One more for Soldier of Fortune. - Soldier of Fortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.85,0:59:22.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恶!  你们以为这是什么?  马戏班?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it! What the hell do you think this is? Some kind of a circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.86,0:59:24.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,滚开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.86,0:59:27.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林顿  天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clinton, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.36,0:59:31.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没听见吗?  我叫你们等我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didrt you get the word? I told you people to wait until I got up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.86,0:59:35.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在象我们射击  威尔  我不愿冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was shooting at us, Will, Come on, I wasrt taking any chances,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.37,0:59:38.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊  乱七八糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ, what a mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.87,0:59:43.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,马上掘出他的尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to dig his body out of there right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.38,0:59:48.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,推土机上不来  你必须找人掘出他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't get a dozer up here, You'll have to find somebody to dig him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.38,0:59:50.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,是你弄的一团糟  克林顿  你来清理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your mess, Clinton, You clean it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.88,0:59:53.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔  别这样  我明天必须回药房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, come on! I gotta be back at the drugstore tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.39,0:59:56.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,你最好立刻开始动手  克林顿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you better get started right away, Clinton!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.39,1:00:00.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.94,1:00:48.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,被一群周末战士埋葬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buried in a hole by a bunch of goddamn weekend warriors.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.94,1:00:51.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说他是你训练过最优秀的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said he was the best you ever trained,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.44,1:00:54.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,他当时是很特别的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However he may have ended up, there was a time when he was very special
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.95,1:00:58.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,特别个屁  只是另一个违法流浪汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special, my ass, He's just another drifter that broke the law,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.45,1:01:00.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,罪名是流浪罪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vagrancy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.45,1:01:03.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,刻在阿灵顿公墓他的墓碑很好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's gonna look real good on his gravestone at Arlington,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.96,1:01:07.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是赢得国会勋章的蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Here lies John Rambo, winner of the Congressional Medal of Honor,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.96,1:01:10.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,从敌后无数任务中生还{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}survivor of countless incursions behind enemy lines,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.46,1:01:14.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,在美国因流浪而被杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killed for vagrancy in jerkwarter, U.S.A."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.47,1:01:17.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,少跟我胡说这些  崔普曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now don't give me any of that crap, Trautman.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.97,1:01:21.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你以为只有他在越南吃过苦头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think Rambo was the only guy who had a tough time in Vietnam?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.47,1:01:23.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed a police officer for Christ sake!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.98,1:01:26.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,他没杀光你们算你们走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You' re goddamn lucky he didn't kill all of ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.50,1:01:47.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个人  他带着忠告来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This character, he comes waltzing in here full of all kinds of good advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.00,1:01:50.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,像是我们该如何放这个疯子走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On how we should let the goddamn maniac go loose so we can save our own asses!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.50,1:01:54.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们才能保命  上校  我们保命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We saved our asses, Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.01,1:01:57.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,也没让他逃走  最优秀的人输了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we didn't let him go loose! The best man lost!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.01,1:01:59.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,他却不满意!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he doesn't like it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.11,1:03:34.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗  威尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How ya doir, Will?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.11,1:03:35.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的电话全挡掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold my calls
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.25,1:05:57.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,上校?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.25,1:06:03.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a seat,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.26,1:06:10.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,小姐  请再做次好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, miss, would you do this again, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.26,1:06:14.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 警长  - 给我的朋友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, sheriff. - And for my friend,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.77,1:06:16.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我个野火鸡牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a shooter. Wild Turkey,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.77,1:06:23.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有点过分  我想道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if I was out of line before, well, I just want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.78,1:06:28.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在那没差别了  对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of that makes much difference now, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.28,1:06:35.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想没有  我想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, I guess not, I suppose,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.79,1:06:39.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道  我只是觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, I just feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.79,1:06:44.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,好像你是作弊而得胜?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you were cheated out of your chance,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.80,1:06:46.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想要宰那小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to kill that kid,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.80,1:06:50.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,非常想  我可以感觉得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to kill him so bad I could taste it,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.30,1:06:54.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,戴着那徽章不好做吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't sit well with that badge, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.81,1:06:58.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,有时你会很困惑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can get confusing sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.31,1:07:02.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你得相信  在越南时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Vietnam, you can bet that
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.81,1:07:06.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我和蓝波也很困惑  但是我们有命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo and I got pretty confused. But we had orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.32,1:07:10.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,怀疑只有死路一条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When in doubt, kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.83,1:07:15.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样  与你无关  你是个平民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell, you're a civilian,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.33,1:07:17.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go home
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.83,1:07:20.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,回到妻子身边回到房子小花园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your wife and your house and your little flower garden,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.33,1:07:22.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没有想透那些事的压力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're under no pressure to figure all this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.33,1:07:25.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?  上校  你从这些事想透什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you, Colonel? What did you figure out from all of this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.84,1:07:28.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,若你是我  他进本镇你会怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you have done with him if he came in?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.34,1:07:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥抱热吻他?  {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you wrap your arms around him,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.98,1:07:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是干掉他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give him a big, sloppy kiss? Or would you have blown his brains out?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.35,1:07:45.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要面对他才能回答这问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't answer that until I met him face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.36,1:07:48.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.36,1:07:50.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.36,1:07:54.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是你没机会知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just as well we never got a chance to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.48,1:09:47.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.98,1:09:51.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,别看我  看路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me, look at the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.48,1:09:54.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,车祸就是这么发生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how accidents happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.99,1:09:58.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字?  - 卡特劳勃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name?  - Cathcan't, Robert A,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.99,1:10:02.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 车后面装了什么  劳勃?  - M16步枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, what do ya got in the back, Robert A?  - M16.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.00,1:10:07.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,好  劳勃  下车去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Robert A, get outta the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.00,1:10:09.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,拜托  我跟你无冤无仇  别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please, I got no beef with you. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.00,1:10:12.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,下去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on! Move! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.53,1:10:35.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,5个越共正开车向中部行驶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SP Car 1, Charlie 5 to central
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.03,1:10:37.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,声音开大点?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to turn that up?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.03,1:10:38.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们还在三线联播?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we still on that three-way hookup?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.53,1:10:40.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,提索警长的办公室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff Teasle' s office,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.53,1:10:42.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗杰  - 还在尝试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger. - Still working.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.53,1:10:44.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么消息!  福安?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your story, Steamboat?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.04,1:10:49.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来有人太快结案了  那个蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like somebody pulled the plug too soon. That Rambo guy
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.04,1:10:51.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,又逃脱了  可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is on the loose again. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.54,1:10:53.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰  福安  这是猎人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, Steamboat. This is Trapper.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.04,1:10:55.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在26号高速公路上设置路障{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're setting up roadblocks on Highway 26.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.05,1:10:58.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔  是蓝波  他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Will, it's Rambo, He's still around,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.94,1:14:43.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!  快离开  走啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy fuck! All right, get out there right away, Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.47,1:15:10.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is goir on anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.47,1:15:16.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心点  - 要爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch yourself!  - They're all gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.48,1:15:28.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,全体市民注意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all civilians,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.49,1:15:34.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,为自身安全  请立刻撤离街道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your own safety, please evacuate the streets immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.99,1:15:38.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,待在室内直到接到进一步指示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remain indoors until you receive further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.50,1:15:40.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,重覆  这是紧急事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, this is a police emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.00,1:15:43.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,请立刻撤离街道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please evacuate the streets immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.52,1:16:04.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现了蓝波的尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found Rambo's body.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.52,1:16:09.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,事实上  他偷了军车  炸了加油站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, it stole an Army truck, blew up a gas station,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.03,1:16:13.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,那小子又复活了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kid is resilient,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.03,1:16:15.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,打消你现在的念头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget what you're thinking and clear out while you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.03,1:16:16.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,还走得开之前快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.53,1:16:19.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,你带着你的忠告一起滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your advice with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.54,1:16:24.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,下午我们谈话时你就知道他活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I talked to you earlier, you knew he was still alive, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.04,1:16:29.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我怀疑  - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I suspected.  - Yeah, sure,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.05,1:16:32.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你赖着不走的原因  你训练他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you stuck around, You trained him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.55,1:16:35.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你教他如何逃出那种洞穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You taught him how to get out of places like that cave,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.55,1:16:38.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他是逃不出这地方的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's not gonna get out of this place,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.06,1:16:42.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,提索  你和你的人过去都对付不了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teasle, you and all your men couldn't handle him before,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.06,1:16:43.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,你现在凭什么认为你能对付他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think you can handle him now?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.06,1:16:46.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,天知道他现在准备干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because God knows what damage he's perpared to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.08,1:17:00.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会死的  提索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna die, Teasle.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.58,1:17:02.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,人都会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody dies,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.08,1:17:05.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,这屋内只有一个人有五成机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one man in this room that's got half a chance,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.08,1:17:08.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,不因为我比他厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not because I'm better than he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.09,1:17:09.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,是因为他信任我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because he trusts me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.09,1:17:12.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是他仅有最亲近的亲人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I' m the closest thing to family he has left.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.59,1:17:14.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许这正是我所需的优势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That may be all the edge I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.09,1:17:17.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!  你们这些人从那里来?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ, where do you people come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.10,1:17:25.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,不不  这是我的镇  这是我的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, No, this is my job, Trautman, This is my town,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.60,1:17:29.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会把它交给你或蓝波或是任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not giving it up to you or to Rambo or to anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.61,1:17:32.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你别挡我的路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you just stay the hell out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.12,1:17:45.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 接近点  - 我不能  还是太热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get a little closer!  - I can't! It's too goddamn hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.63,1:17:49.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔  我是莱斯特  听见没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, this is Lester. Do you copy? Over,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.63,1:17:53.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,快  我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.13,1:17:55.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔  我是莱斯特  听见没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, this is Lester. Do you copy? Over,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.13,1:18:00.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着  威尔  我们有严重问题  公路被切断了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Will, we got some serious problems. The highway's been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.64,1:18:03.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡车在这里  但我们找不到尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truck's out here, but we couldn't find the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.64,1:18:06.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,重复  没尸体  全烧毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, no body. It's totally burned out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.64,1:18:09.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,布莱斯  把那些人赶开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preston, get those people outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.65,1:18:12.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,移到南边去!  退后!  退后!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move 'em back to the south side. Move back! Move back!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.15,1:18:14.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着  威尔  我们不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Will we don't know how many...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.65,1:18:17.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,汽油槽里存有多少气体泵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gasoline reservoirs there are under those gas pumps.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.66,1:18:24.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你听到了吗?  - 我们这有个报道员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you copy? Over.  - We got a reporter here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.66,1:18:27.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,普雷斯顿  把他们推开!  我不管他是谁!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preston, push them back! I don't care who he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.67,1:18:34.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他们分散开!  把卡车开到另一边!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move them around! Get the trucks to the other side!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.17,1:18:35.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,快  我们走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.67,1:18:37.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,威尔  你听到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will, do you copy? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.35,1:21:33.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恶  可恶  可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it! Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.51,1:24:13.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,开枪  开枪  开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Go ahead,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.51,1:24:16.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 开枪啊!  你这疯子  - 蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go ahead, you crazy son of a bitch! Finish!  - Rambo!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.35,1:24:23.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪  听我说  你没有机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rambo, don't do it! Listen to me, Rambo. You have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.36,1:24:26.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So drop your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.86,1:24:29.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要命令直升机  载你回布莱登堡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna order the chopper in to fly you back to Bragg,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.36,1:24:33.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,停火!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.37,1:24:39.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恩  停火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kern! Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.37,1:24:41.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,停火  停火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire. Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.37,1:24:44.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,考虑一下你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about what you're doing,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.88,1:24:49.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,这地方被团团围住  没有出路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The building's perimeter is covered, No exits.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.38,1:24:52.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,外面将近二百人  M十六多得是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are nearly 200 men out there and a lot of M16s.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.88,1:24:55.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不择手段造成这场私人战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did everything to make this private war happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.39,1:24:59.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你造成的破坏够多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done enough damage!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.39,1:25:01.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,任务结束了  明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mission is over, Rambo. Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.39,1:25:04.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,任务已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mission is over!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.40,1:25:09.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at 'em out there,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.90,1:25:13.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,看他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.41,1:25:18.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,若你现在不结束他们会杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't end this now, they're gonna kill you,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.91,1:25:20.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是你想要的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.91,1:25:27.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,结束了  强尼  结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over, Johnny, It 's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.42,1:25:30.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没结束!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is over! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.42,1:25:32.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,不像关开关那么容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just don't turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.42,1:25:34.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,越战不是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't my war!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.43,1:25:36.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,是你要求我参战  不是我要求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked me, I didn't ask you!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.43,1:25:38.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我采取必要手段打胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did what I had to do to win!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.43,1:25:40.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,但别人却另生枝节  不让我们打胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But somebody wouldn't let us win!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.43,1:25:44.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我回国  在机场遭遇愤怒群众{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I come back to the world, and I see all those maggots at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.44,1:25:49.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,指责我是杀婴孩的凶手等等胡言乱语!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}protestir me, spittir, callir me 'Baby Killer' and all kinds of vile crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.94,1:25:52.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们算什么?  竟来抗议我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they to protest me, huh? Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.94,1:25:54.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非他们曾是我  去过越南{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless they've been me and been there
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.95,1:25:56.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道他们所骂的是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and know what they're yelling about!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.45,1:25:58.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,那时代让大家都不好受  蓝波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a bad time for everyone, Rambo.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.45,1:26:00.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,都是过去的事了  对你而言是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all in the past now, For you!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.95,1:26:02.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,对我而言  平民生活什么都不是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, civilian life is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.95,1:26:04.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,在战场上我们有荣誉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the field, we had a code of honor:
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.96,1:26:06.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,大家互相照顾掩护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You watch my back, I watch yours,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.96,1:26:07.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,回到这里  什么也不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back here there's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.96,1:26:10.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是全连仅剩的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the last of an elite group.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.96,1:26:12.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,别落到这般下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't end it like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.46,1:26:15.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,在越南  我可以驾炮艇  开坦克车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back there I could fly a gunship, I could drive a tank,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.47,1:26:16.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我负责上百万的装备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in charge of million-dollar equipment!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.97,1:26:20.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,在这里我连停车的工作都找不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back here I can't even hold a job parking cars!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.47,1:26:25.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,靠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck it. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.98,1:26:29.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Geez, Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.98,1:26:32.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,大家都到那里去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.49,1:26:41.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有个朋友  丹福斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a friend, it was Danforth.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.49,1:26:43.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是有这些好兄弟  伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had all these guys, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.99,1:26:48.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,在越南我们相依为命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back there I had all these flaky guys who were my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.50,1:26:50.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,回到这里什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back here there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.50,1:26:52.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,记得丹福斯吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember Danforth?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.00,1:26:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他穿着黑头巾 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wore this black headband.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.91,1:26:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 我拿了他的一只颜色笔  上面写着: "如果找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I took one of his magic markers and it said, "If found.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.51,1:27:00.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,寄到拉斯维加斯"  因为我们常谈那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mail us to Las Vegas", 'cause we were always talking about Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.01,1:27:04.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有58年分红色雪佛来蓬车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his fuckir car, this red '58 Chevy convertible.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.52,1:27:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他总是谈论着那车 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was talking about this car.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.98,1:27:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说要开着它直到车轮掉下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} He said we were gonna cruise 'til the tires fall off,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.53,1:27:19.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,在西贡市  有个小孩走来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go in this bar in Saigon, and this kid comes up
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.03,1:27:25.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,带着擦靴箱  他说 擦靴吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}carrying a shoe shine box. And he says, "Shine, please, Shine."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.04,1:27:28.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说不要  乔伊说要擦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said no. He kept askir, and Joey said yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.04,1:27:33.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿麦酒  箱中装了引线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I went to get a couple beers, And the box is wired,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.04,1:27:34.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,小孩打开箱子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he opened up the box.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.55,1:27:37.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,把乔伊尸首炸得到处都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuckir blew his body all over the place,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.55,1:27:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处分散 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's layir there, He's fuckir screamir,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.45,1:27:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, 我身上都是碎尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} There's pieces of him all over me, Just... like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.55,1:27:44.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我试图把碎尸拉下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm tryir to pull him off,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.56,1:27:46.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友的身体粘的我全身都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my friend that's all over me!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.06,1:27:50.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,血与其他的融在一起  我想把他拼回来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got blood and everything. I'm tryir to hold him together.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.06,1:27:52.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想把他拼回来!  但是老是不成功!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm puttir the guy's fuckir insides keep comir out!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.56,1:27:56.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我找人帮忙  可没人帮忙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nobody would help! Nobody would help!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.57,1:27:58.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我听到乔伊说  我要回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's sayir, "I wanna go home, I wanna go home."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.57,1:28:01.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,他一直叫我名字说  我要回家  强尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He keeps callir my name. "I wanna go home, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.57,1:28:03.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要开雪佛来车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna drive my Chevy."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.07,1:28:05.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说  不行  我找不到你的腿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, "Why I can't find your fuckir legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.58,1:28:08.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我找不到你的腿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find your legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.08,1:28:12.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我忘不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get it out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.58,1:28:15.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,七年了  每一天都想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dream it seven years. Every day I have this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.09,1:28:18.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,有时我醒来  不知身在何处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I wake up, I don't know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.59,1:28:21.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不跟任何人说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't talk to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.59,1:28:24.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,有时一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.60,1:28:28.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,有时一星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes a week.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.70,1:28:31.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我忘不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't put it out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.73,1:28:39.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,靠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck it.
